cff-version: "1.2.0"

message: >-
If you use flowMagic in your research, please cite the associated preprint
below and report the version of flowMagic used.

type: software

title: "flowMagic"

abstract: >-
flowMagic is an R package for automated gating of bivariate flow cytometry
data. It provides machine-learning-based gating, visualization tools, and
integration with the flowCore and flowWorkspace ecosystems.

